note right of procedure_cases
  PERIOPERATIVE CASE
  Request -> scheduling -> preoperative clearance -> WHO safety checks -> anesthesia
  -> operative steps/findings/devices/specimens -> PACU -> follow-up/outcomes/billing.
end note

note right of surgical_safety_checklists
  Checklist responses are phase-specific and immutable. Exceptions require a reason;
  mandatory unresolved items block the configured workflow transition.
end note

note right of procedure_implants
  Implant traceability retains UDI/lot/serial, body site, procedure and lifecycle dates,
  supporting recalls and longitudinal patient safety without storing binary files here.
end note

